              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 4,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ppMgw",
                  "name": "title",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "content": "A7 · States",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 22,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "S37kd",
                  "name": "description",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Hover steps the background up one level (bg-hover → bg-active; brand → brand-hover). Pressed = hover + 85% opacity. Focus = 2 px ring in focus-ring. Disabled = 40% opacity and no hover. 120 ms transition. Shadow only on floating layers (menu and modal); buttons, fields and the chat pill have no shadow. Secondary button on a card (bg-hover): bg-active background, hover border-strong, otherwise it vanishes into the card. Cursor: hand (pointer) on everything clickable (buttons, icon button, toggle, Bot rows, menu and list items, shape and color options, attachment). Text fields keep the text cursor (I-beam); disabled keeps the arrow. Menu items are Button / Ghost at full width (transparent background, hover bg-hover); the destructive one is Button / Ghost · Danger (hover danger-hover). The account dropdown has only Settings and Sign out, with no header or separator; the separator exists in the Menu component for when it is needed, edge to edge. Shadow only on the floating container, soft; buttons inside stay flat. Error (every input): 2 border in danger and EVERYTHING in danger-text: the label, the typed text (and the placeholder) and the message below, which replaces the hint. With a label, the label turns red; with a message, the message turns red.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
