                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "What opens when clicking + (new Bot modal; sheet on mobile) and on the account (dropdown with Settings and Sign out on hover). Rule for every modal: max height = window height − 48 on each side. When the content exceeds that, it scrolls and the thin bar (8 track, 4 bar) appears flush with the modal's right edge, starting at the top of the first content row. Enable the component's 'scrollbar' layer.",
